<title>NETHERLANDS: PIRELLI TYRE PROVISIONAL 96 NET NLG 95 MLN.</title>
<headline>PIRELLI TYRE PROVISIONAL 96 NET NLG 95 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pirelli-Tyre Holding NV said provisional figures showed it made a net profit of some 95 million guilders in 1996, a rise of some 42 million guilders compared with 1995.</p>
<p>Amsterdam-listed Pirelli-Tyre is 81 percent owned by Italy's Pirelli SpA .</p>
